---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="What FarmNerds is and who is behind it." section="about">
  <div class="stack">
    <div class="pagehead"><span class="chip">About</span><h1>Powered by brisket, bandwidth, and bad ideas.</h1></div>
    <div class="md">
      <p>FarmNerds is where tech meets the dirt. It is run by JD out of Stephenville, Texas, and covers three things: tech, homelabbing and homesteading. Where they overlap, that is FarmLabs.</p>
      <p>Reviews here cover tools, equipment, software, farm equipment, techniques and builds. Each one gets a score out of 10 and a plain list of pros and cons.</p>
      <p>The scripts and recipes behind the homelab posts live on <a href="https://github.com/farmnerds-net">GitHub</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
